# Tooling / local agent state
.serena/
.claude/
.zcode/

# Build output
out/
bin/
*.apk

# LuCI UI bundles — rebuilt from src/ by `npm run build` in CI (build.yml /
# auto-version.yml) and copied into the package by Dockerfile-apk. Never
# committed: committing them caused src/ fixes to silently never ship, because
# nothing regenerated the bundles. build-id.txt is stamped at package-build
# time; favicon.svg/icons.svg live in ui/public and are emitted by the build.
luci-app-splify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/splify/*.js
luci-app-splify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/splify/*.css

# Python caches (reference control server)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
